{"title":"我会常务副会长单位——永道咨询公司获批设立广州市博士后创新实践基地！","date":"2024-06-28","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">我会常务副会长单位</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nmso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&mdash;&mdash;<span style=\"letter-spacing:.4pt\">永道咨询公司</span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nmso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:.4pt\">获批设立广州市博士后创新实践基地！</span></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">济济多士，乃成大业。<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">21</span>日，由广州市人力资源和社会保障局举办的<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年广州市博士后设站（基地）单位业务培训交流会圆满召开。我会常务副会长单位</span><span style=\"text-indent: 32.6pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.15pt;\">永道工程咨询有限公司</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 华文中宋; font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: 1.15pt;\">作为广州第十一批广州市博士后创新实践基地入选单位参加授牌仪式。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.6pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/%E5%9B%BE%E4%B8%80(1).png\" style=\"width: 1080px; height: 588px;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">广州市博士后创新实践基地，是紧跟国家、省、市重大部署，实施人才战略的重要内容，是促进高层次人才培养、高精尖人才聚集、科技持续创新和科研成果转化的重要载体，是推动建设粤港澳大湾区高水平人才高地的重要举措。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.6pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/%E5%9B%BE%E4%BA%8C.jpg\" style=\"width: 1080px; height: 588px;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">创新之道，人才为基。多年来，永道公司始终践行&ldquo;智慧服务，完美增值&rdquo;使命，牢牢把握&ldquo;发展是第一要务，人才是第一资源，创新是第一动力&rdquo;理念，以智慧之思、创新之火、人才之力护航建设项目增价值、增效益。实践完善制度建设、承担科技创新项目、推进产学研合作、开创人才工作新局面等举措，积极为各类人才创造大有可为、大有作为的理想之地。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.6pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/%E5%9B%BE%E4%B8%89.jpg\" style=\"width: 1280px; height: 960px;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">继二零二三年获得广东省人力资源和社会保障厅批准，入选第八批广东省博士后创新实践基地后，永道再次荣幸获得广州市博士后创新实践基地荣誉，标志着其在人才培养和科技人才平台建设方面取得了新的突破，科研能力、创新实力再上新台阶。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.6pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/%E5%9B%BE%E5%9B%9B.jpg\" style=\"width: 1080px; height: 714px;\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.6pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.15pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">风起南海，潮涌珠江。未来，永道将继续以博士后创新实践基地平台为依托，深入实施创新驱动发展战略，加快建立人才资源竞争优势，充分发挥引才聚才和创新主体作用，做好博士后&ldquo;筑巢引凤&rdquo;的培育和服务工作，扎实推动科研技术创新与成果转化，为工程咨询行业高质量发展提供强有力的智力支撑，为广州高质量发展、新质生产力发展注入动能！</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>"}